{"id":"e7a320aa-63f3-464b-b59b-7a430decf084","object":"chat.completion","created":1784808213,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    payload = case['payload']\\n    word_tok_idx = payload['word_token_indices']\\n    word_labels = payload['word_labels']\\n    token_count = payload['token_count']\\n    if len(word_tok_idx) != len(word_labels):\\n        raise ValueError('word_token_indices and word_labels length mismatch')\\n    token_labels = [None] * token_count\\n    all_indices = set()\\n    for indices in word_tok_idx:\\n        for idx in indices:\\n            if idx < 0 or idx >= token_count:\\n                raise ValueError(f'token index {idx} out of range')\\n            if idx in all_indices:\\n                raise ValueError('overlapping token indices')\\n            all_indices.add(idx)\\n    for indices, label in zip(word_tok_idx, word_labels):\\n        for idx in indices:\\n            if token_labels[idx] is not None:\\n                raise ValueError('overlapping token assignment')\\n            token_labels[idx] = label\\n    if any(lbl is None for lbl in token_labels):\\n        raise ValueError('uncovered token indices')\\n    token_labels = [int(lbl) for lbl in token_labels]\\n    retained_indices = [i for i, lbl in enumerate(token_labels) if lbl == 1]\\n    result = {\\n        'case_id': case['case_id'],\\n        '_case_nonce': payload['_case_nonce'],\\n        'token_labels': token_labels,\\n        'retained_indices': retained_indices\\n    }\\n    return result\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to parse the task: Implement `solve(case)` that returns a JSON-serializable object. The case has payload with `word_token_indices`, `word_labels`, `token_count`. Need to project word-level labels onto subword tokens. Each word group has a list of token indices. Must broadcast word label to each token. Reject overlapping, out-of-range, or uncovere